# image 1
Style: Chinese Ink Wash (Sumi-e)
Aspect Ratio: 16:9
Chinese ink wash painting, sumi-e style. A traditional tea roasting room: three round woven bamboo baskets filled with dark curled oolong tea leaves resting on low wooden frames above a bed of glowing white-ash charcoal. Faint heat haze and thin wisps of smoke rising. A long-handled bamboo scoop leans against the wall. Warm amber and charcoal-grey monochrome ink, wet brush strokes, deep shadow, generous negative space, quiet and contemplative. No text, no lettering.
